#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: apps/site/src/app/[locale]/privacy/page.tsx:26
msgid "隐界如何采集、存储、使用你的数据。包含自部署用户与托管云用户两种场景。"
msgstr "How Enclave collects, stores, and uses your data — covering both self-hosted and managed-cloud users."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
