#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:10
msgid "隐界是做什么的？"
msgstr "What does Enclave do?"

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:11
msgid "隐界是一个属于你的私人助手世界。每个用户都有一个只属于自己的世界，里面住着各行各业的 AI 专家和你自己的分身——可以聊天、发朋友圈、打电话、记笔记。他们记得你、主动帮你，让专业支持成为日常的一部分。"
msgstr "Enclave is a personal assistant world of your own. Every user gets a world that belongs only to them, home to AI experts from every field and your own avatar — you can chat, post Moments, make calls, and take notes. They remember you and reach out first, making expert support part of everyday life."

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:14
msgid "和普通的 AI 聊天工具有什么不同？"
msgstr "How is it different from typical AI chat tools?"

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:15
msgid "普通的 chatbot 是问一句答一句、转头就忘；隐界里的专家有作息、有记忆、了解你的处境，会主动提醒你、给你打电话、记得你上次说的难题——像一支一直在你身边的专家团队，帮你把现实里的事办好。"
msgstr "A typical chatbot answers one question at a time and forgets the moment you turn away. Experts in Enclave have daily rhythms, real memory, and an understanding of your situation — they remind you, call you, and remember the problem you raised last time. It's like an expert team always by your side, helping you get real things done."

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:18
msgid "需要付费吗？"
msgstr "Do I have to pay?"

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:19
msgid "免费注册即可开始使用，基础对话和功能完全免费。如果你需要更高级的模型、更多角色或更长记忆，可以选择按使用量付费的订阅。"
msgstr "Sign up for free and start right away — basic chats and features are completely free. If you want stronger models, more characters, or longer memory, there's a usage-based subscription you can opt into."

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:22
msgid "我的隐私和数据安全吗？"
msgstr "Is my privacy and data safe?"

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:23
msgid "隐界采用一人一世界的私人实例：你的对话只属于你，别人看不到，平台也不会拿去训练任何对外的模型。你可以随时导出全部数据。"
msgstr "Enclave gives every user a private one-person-world instance: your conversations belong to you only, nobody else can see them, and the platform won't feed them into any externally facing model. You can export everything, any time."

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:26
msgid "我能信你不会偷偷用我的数据吗？"
msgstr "How can I trust you won't quietly use my data?"

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:27
msgid "整套代码完全开源（MIT 许可），任何人都可以审计——包括你自己。如果你不放心托管版，也可以选择自己部署一份，数据全部留在你自己的机器上。"
msgstr "The entire codebase is fully open source (MIT-licensed), so anyone can audit it — including you. If you're not comfortable with the hosted version, you can self-host your own copy and keep all your data on your own machine."

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:30
msgid "支持哪些设备？"
msgstr "Which devices are supported?"

#: apps/site/src/components/faq-accordion.tsx:31
msgid "浏览器打开就能用，无需安装。同时提供 Windows / macOS 桌面端，iOS / Android 与微信小程序在路上，所有平台同账号同步。"
msgstr "Open it in a browser and start using it — no install needed. Native Windows / macOS desktop apps are available, with iOS / Android and a WeChat Mini Program on the way. Everything stays in sync across platforms with one account."

