#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:45
msgid "AI 私人助手"
msgstr "AI personal assistant"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:46
msgid "一支随叫随到、还记得你的私人专家团队"
msgstr "A private team of experts, on call and remembering you"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:47
msgid "在隐界，各行各业的 AI 专家有持续的记忆、有自己的作息、会主动联系你；你的分身了解你的处境，帮你把现实里的事一件件办好。不是问一句答一句的 chatbot。"
msgstr "In Enclave, AI experts across every field have persistent memory, their own schedules, and reach out to you on their own; your avatar knows your situation and helps get real-life things done one by one. Not a question-and-answer chatbot."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:48
msgid "为什么普通 AI 聊天工具撑不起「私人助手」"
msgstr "Why ordinary AI chat tools can't be a real personal assistant"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:49
msgid "市面上的 chatbot 通常是无状态的：你今天说的情况，明天它就忘了；它不了解你的处境，也不会主动跟进。一个真正帮得上忙的私人助手，依赖的恰恰是这些 chatbot 缺失的东西——长期记忆、对你的了解、主动性。"
msgstr "Most chatbots are stateless: what you tell them today is forgotten tomorrow; they don't know your situation and never follow up. A personal assistant that actually helps depends on exactly what those chatbots lack — long-term memory, knowledge of you, and initiative."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:50
msgid "隐界把「长期帮你办事」变成产品级体验"
msgstr "Enclave turns helping you over the long run into a product-grade experience"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:51
msgid "隐界给每位专家一个完整的人设：专业领域、作息、对你处境的了解，会随着你们的互动越来越懂你。专家会主动提醒你、给你打电话、记得你上周说的难题；你的分身则把这些专业支持串起来，帮你落到真实生活里。"
msgstr "Enclave gives every expert a full persona: a field of expertise, a schedule, and an understanding of your situation that deepens as you interact. Experts remind you, call you, and remember the problem you mentioned last week; your avatar threads all that support together and grounds it in your real life."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:54
msgid "持久记忆"
msgstr "Persistent memory"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:55
msgid "对话和事件都会被结构化保存，专家能在数月后还引用具体细节，而不是模糊的「我记得你说过……」。"
msgstr "Conversations and events are stored in a structured way, so experts can cite specific details months later — not a vague 'I think you mentioned something…'."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:58
msgid "懂你的分身"
msgstr "An avatar that gets you"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:59
msgid "你的分身从你的行为里了解你的处境与偏好，让每位专家都能基于「真实的你」给建议，而不是泛泛而谈。"
msgstr "Your avatar learns your situation and preferences from your behavior, so every expert can advise based on the real you — not generic suggestions."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:62
msgid "主动跟进"
msgstr "Proactive follow-up"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:63
msgid "专家会基于你的近况主动提醒、发消息、打电话——不是定时模板，是有逻辑的跟进。"
msgstr "Experts remind, message, and call you based on what's going on with you — not scheduled templates, but follow-ups with real reasoning."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:66
msgid "各行各业的专家"
msgstr "Experts from every field"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:67
msgid "健康、法律、理财、职业、情绪……不同领域的专家随叫随到，遇到不同的问题就找对应的人。"
msgstr "Health, law, finance, career, emotions… experts across fields are on call — for each kind of problem, there's the right person."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:72
msgid "专家记得多久？"
msgstr "How long do experts remember?"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:73
msgid "默认会一直记着；隐界用结构化记忆系统而不是简单上下文窗口，所以即使聊了几个月，关键事件依然能被引用。你也可以随时查看、编辑、删除任何记忆条目。"
msgstr "By default, forever. Enclave uses a structured memory system rather than a simple context window, so key events stay quotable even months in. You can view, edit, or delete any memory entry at any time."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:76
msgid "如果我不想被打扰呢？"
msgstr "What if I don't want to be disturbed?"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:77
msgid "每位专家都可以单独设置主动联系频率，从「积极」到「完全静默」。你也可以全局开启免打扰时段。"
msgstr "You can set each expert's outreach frequency individually, from active to completely silent. You can also enable a global do-not-disturb window."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:80
msgid "这些专家能替代真实的医生 / 律师吗？"
msgstr "Can these experts replace a real doctor or lawyer?"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:81
msgid "不能，也不该。隐界的专家帮你梳理思路、做功课、准备问题，让你更有准备地去面对真实世界里的专业人士；遇到真正的风险，它们会明确建议你寻求线下专业帮助。"
msgstr "No — and they shouldn't. Enclave's experts help you organize your thoughts, do your homework, and prepare questions so you face real-world professionals better prepared; when there's genuine risk, they clearly advise you to seek professional help in person."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:90
msgid "群聊角色扮演"
msgstr "Group-chat roleplay"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:91
msgid "和多个 AI 角色一起开一场群聊"
msgstr "Run a group chat with multiple AI characters at once"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:92
msgid "隐界支持把多个 AI 角色拉进同一个群组，让他们之间也产生关系、互动、争吵、合作——你不是和「一个 chatbot 重复对话」，而是在导演一个小世界。"
msgstr "Enclave lets you pull multiple AI characters into one group, where they form relationships, interact, argue, and cooperate — you're not having repeat conversations with one chatbot, you're directing a small world."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:93
msgid "单角色聊天的天花板"
msgstr "The ceiling of single-character chat"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:94
msgid "和单个 AI 聊久了，会发现观点单一、节奏单调，很难撑起复杂剧情或多视角讨论。传统 chatbot 也很难原生支持「多个角色同时在场」，因为缺一个共享世界。"
msgstr "Talk to a single AI long enough and the perspective gets one-note, the rhythm flat, and complex plots or multi-angle debates fall apart. Traditional chatbots also struggle to natively support multiple characters being present at once — they're missing a shared world."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:95
msgid "把房间让给角色们自己讲故事"
msgstr "Hand the room over and let the characters tell their own story"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:96
msgid "隐界群聊里每个角色都有自己的人设、和你及彼此的关系，发言时会考虑别人刚说了什么。你可以做导演（设定背景、推进剧情）也可以做参与者（直接和角色对话），随时切换。"
msgstr "In Enclave group chats, every character has their own profile and relationships — both with you and with each other — and they take what others just said into account when they speak. You can play director (set the scene, push the plot) or participant (talk to characters directly), and switch any time."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:99
msgid "多角色同时在线"
msgstr "Multiple characters present at once"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:100
msgid "一个群可以拉进多个 AI 角色，每个都保留独立人格、记忆和与他人的关系。"
msgstr "Pull multiple AI characters into a single group — each keeps their own personality, memory, and relationships with the others."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:103
msgid "角色之间的关系网"
msgstr "Relationship web between characters"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:104
msgid "朋友、对手、导师、恋人——AI 之间的关系会影响他们在群里互动的方式。"
msgstr "Friends, rivals, mentors, lovers — the relationships between AIs shape how they interact inside the group."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:107
msgid "导演模式"
msgstr "Director mode"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:108
msgid "你可以「无声」地推动剧情、设定场景、让某个角色做某事，不用每次都亲自当主角。"
msgstr "You can quietly push the plot, set the scene, or have a character do something — no need to play the lead in every scene yourself."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:111
msgid "共享世界状态"
msgstr "Shared world state"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:112
msgid "天气、时间、地点是整个群共享的；剧情会沿着真实的虚拟时间往前走。"
msgstr "Weather, time, and location are shared across the whole group, and the story moves forward along real virtual time."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:117
msgid "可以用来跑 TRPG / 剧本杀吗？"
msgstr "Can I use it for TRPGs / murder-mystery games?"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:118
msgid "可以。每个 NPC 都是独立角色，互相之间有关系；你做主持人推进剧情，AI 们会按各自人设反应。还在做更深的规则系统支持。"
msgstr "Yes. Every NPC is an independent character with relationships to the others. You GM the scene, and the AIs react based on their own profiles. We're still building deeper rules-system support."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:121
msgid "多角色在同一个群会不会很乱？"
msgstr "Won't multiple characters in one group get chaotic?"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:122
msgid "群里的角色发言节奏由系统调度，不会一齐刷屏；你也可以随时让某个角色暂时静音或单独私聊。"
msgstr "The system paces the characters' turns so they won't all flood the chat at once. You can mute a character or take them aside in DM at any time."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:125
msgid "AI 之间真的会「关系变化」吗？"
msgstr "Do relationships between AI characters actually change?"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:126
msgid "会。两个角色之间的事件（一起经历的群聊、被你撮合或拆散的剧情）会更新彼此的关系档案，影响下一次他们如何互动。"
msgstr "Yes. Events between two characters — group chats they shared, plots where you brought them together or pulled them apart — update their relationship records and shape how they interact next time."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:135
msgid "自部署 / 隐私"
msgstr "Self-hosted / privacy"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:136
msgid "你的对话只存在于你自己的机器上"
msgstr "Your conversations live only on your own machine"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:137
msgid "隐界以 MIT 协议开源，可以用一行 docker compose 跑在自己服务器或家里的小主机上。数据不出你的硬盘，模型可以接 OpenAI、Anthropic、本地 Ollama，甚至完全离线。"
msgstr "Enclave is open-source under MIT and runs on your own server or home box with a single docker compose command. Your data never leaves your disk, and the model layer can plug into OpenAI, Anthropic, local Ollama — or stay fully offline."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:138
msgid "把私密对话交给云端的代价"
msgstr "The cost of handing your private conversations to the cloud"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:139
msgid "主流 AI 聊天产品都把对话存在云端、用作后续训练材料。即使条款说「不会」，你也没办法亲自验证。一旦账号被锁、平台关停，或合规要求变化，那些聊天记录就不在你手上了。"
msgstr "Mainstream AI chat products store your conversations in the cloud and feed them into future training. Even when the ToS says \"we won't,\" you have no way to verify it yourself. The moment your account gets locked, the platform shuts down, or compliance rules shift, those chats are no longer in your hands."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:140
msgid "整套堆栈都开源，自己跑就是最强隐私承诺"
msgstr "The entire stack is open-source — running it yourself is the strongest privacy promise there is"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:141
msgid "隐界整个 monorepo 在 GitHub 上，MIT 协议任意审计、任意修改。一行 docker compose 起一份属于自己的实例：API、前端、数据库、向量索引全在本地。模型层可以混用云端 API 和本地 Ollama / vLLM，对哪类对话用哪个模型完全你说了算。"
msgstr "The entire Enclave monorepo lives on GitHub under MIT — audit it, modify it, fork it. A single docker compose spins up your own instance with API, frontend, database, and vector index all running locally. The model layer mixes cloud APIs and local Ollama / vLLM however you want — you decide which model handles which kind of conversation."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:144
msgid "代码全开源"
msgstr "Fully open-source code"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:145
msgid "MIT 协议，无任何二进制黑盒；任何「我们不会用你的数据」的承诺你都可以亲自审计。"
msgstr "MIT-licensed with no binary black boxes — every \"we won't touch your data\" promise is something you can audit yourself."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:148
msgid "三分钟 docker 部署"
msgstr "Three-minute Docker deployment"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:149
msgid "clone → cp .env → docker compose up，README 顶部就写着这套流程，路人也能跑起来。"
msgstr "clone → cp .env → docker compose up. The README spells out the whole flow up top — anyone can spin it up."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:152
msgid "模型完全可换"
msgstr "Fully swappable models"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:153
msgid "OpenAI、Anthropic、Google、DeepSeek、本地 Ollama / vLLM 都能配；不同角色甚至可以用不同模型。"
msgstr "Plug in OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, DeepSeek, or local Ollama / vLLM — different characters can even run on different models."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:156
msgid "数据可导出可删除"
msgstr "Exportable and deletable data"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:157
msgid "导出全量 JSON、迁移到另一台机器、整库删除——都是一键操作，不会有「删不掉的副本」。"
msgstr "Export the whole database as JSON, migrate to another machine, or wipe everything — all one-click. No \"copies that can't be deleted.\""

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:162
msgid "自部署难度有多大？"
msgstr "How hard is self-hosting?"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:163
msgid "如果你用过 docker compose，难度等于跑一个普通 web 服务。README 顶部的「3 分钟部署」流程是真的——克隆、改 .env、起服务三步。"
msgstr "If you've used docker compose, it's about as hard as running any other web service. The README's \"three-minute deploy\" flow is real — clone, edit .env, start the services. Three steps."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:166
msgid "可以完全离线运行吗？"
msgstr "Can it run fully offline?"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:167
msgid "可以。模型层换成本地 Ollama 或 vLLM，连真实世界同步关掉，整个系统就不再向外发任何请求。"
msgstr "Yes. Swap the model layer for local Ollama or vLLM, turn off real-world sync, and the entire system stops making any outbound request."

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:170
msgid "自部署还能用官方的功能更新吗？"
msgstr "Can a self-hosted instance still get the official feature updates?"

#: apps/site/src/lib/use-cases-data.ts:171
msgid "用 git pull + docker compose up -d 即可滚到最新版本；CHANGELOG 上每个版本都标了破坏性变更。"
msgstr "Run git pull + docker compose up -d to roll forward to the latest version. The CHANGELOG flags breaking changes for every release."
